      ],
      "text": "The orchestrator is an agentic orchestration layer built on Azure AI Foundry Agent Service and the Microsoft Agent Framework, coordinating multiple specialized agents for agent-based RAG workflows."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_e02f2391364eadb58276d037a4194ba59403ed8aa5e05a0404e77166952589f4",
