          "line_end": 30,
          "line_start": 24,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "azure/gpt-rag-orchestrator",
          "url": "https://github.com/Azure/gpt-rag-orchestrator/blob/9b64a5b962067161cb55252c6e0917a2738ba984/README.md#L24-L30"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_88b5c14ffaa0eb4bd45abd670bc95c20f87906b11770fab4263049ca6e67895c"
      ],
      "text": "Five selectable strategies are documented: single_agent_rag, maf_agent_service, maf_lite, mcp, and nl2sql, each keyed by an AGENT_STRATEGY value."
    },
