          "repository": "azure/gpt-rag-orchestrator",
          "url": "https://github.com/Azure/gpt-rag-orchestrator/blob/9b64a5b962067161cb55252c6e0917a2738ba984/README.md#L146-L158"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_17c38da4bbca87b80bdd3d7aca1d38680fc94a9720c83ce2956964188f76958e"
      ],
      "text": "For Toolbox-backed strategies (currently only mcp), x-agent-foundry-call-id is strictly validated (printable ASCII, max 256 chars) and missing or malformed values are rejected with HTTP 401 before any strategy or Toolbox client runs."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f68b92502c990245a0c898d6a849ee62dcb94c19a027dbd41508e4b1aeff88b1",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "9b64a5b962067161cb55252c6e0917a2738ba984",
          "git_sha": "6ac7c4075f6aac30e19287b94ad3313bab328fb3",
          "line_end": 166,
          "line_start": 160,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "azure/gpt-rag-orchestrator",
          "url": "https://github.com/Azure/gpt-rag-orchestrator/blob/9b64a5b962067161cb55252c6e0917a2738ba984/README.md#L160-L166"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_45959224d50b8319a385d8482e951114a3e8b5e112358cb530a5b5201e8aac00"
      ],
      "text": "The container never reads or forwards the Authorization header (stripped by the platform gateway), never trusts caller- or model-supplied identity fields for retrieval security, and never logs call ids or authorization material."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_80a805f59573fb2411919fc956a519e5058d22659062f9bc3676b031b03ce0f2",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
