        "slc_df64e8b8da29aa71cbe7ec92cf65446b5abb023c7f0fdd98680b3cd7c9fa658e"
      ],
      "text": "The optional admin dashboard reads from the orchestrator's conversation/history Cosmos DB container (CONVERSATIONS_DATABASE_CONTAINER in DATABASE_NAME) and is read-only."
    },
