        "slc_c8e8802f0f21a8f89e9b561ec8b01ade869c347ea937a2c8096f50886c19493a"
      ],
      "text": "Audit events are disabled by default, emitted under the gptrag.audit namespace, and enabling them requires a valid 256-bit HMAC key or startup fails."
    },
